Totally possible. He does come back from time to time even after sacrificing himself (albiet in vein) to try and stop Omnitron 1. I really feel that his major story arch (as far as SotM goes) has been told. We have his begining (omnitron 1) middle (small cameo apperances sprinkled around) and end (omnitron IV) already. Maybe something happens in those middle cameo&#39;s that warrents a promo card and side story, and thats a valid argument to make. But I don&#39;t see the evidence to suggest anything major story wise happens with him.&nbsp; .&nbsp;
